# Moonstone Harbinger: "This ability triggers only once each turn" (the card's own text, which no numbered rule covers). On turn 1 Bot1 gains 3 life with Healing Salve (2/3)
# and then loses 3 to its own Lightning Bolt: no second trigger, still a 2/3 and nothing on the stack. The pump wears off, and on turn 3 a
# second Healing Salve triggers it again (a 2/3).

